---
---

<section id="process" class="border-y-2 border-[#1c1b1b] py-20 px-4 md:px-8 bg-[#1c1b1b] text-white relative overflow-hidden my-12 scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-overlay opacity-10"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs font-bold uppercase text-[#00aeef] bg-[#00aeef]/10 px-3 py-1 border border-[#00aeef] inline-block mb-3">
        FLUXO DE TRABALHO DIGITAL
      </span>
      <h3 class="font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white">
        Processo de Trabalho Digital
      </h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] mt-2 max-w-2xl">
        Da pré-impressão ao corte final em minutos: máxima produtividade com zero desperdício de tempo e material.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-0 border-2 border-white/20 font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace]">
      <!-- 01 RIP ENGINE -->
      <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-white/20 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 hover:bg-[#fafafc] hover:text-[#0f172a] transition-all duration-300 group min-h-[180px] md:min-h-[260px] cursor-crosshair">
        <span class="font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-6xl font-black opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:text-[#0f172a] transition-all">01</span>
        <div>
          <span class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs font-bold uppercase block mb-2 group-hover:text-[#00658d]">
            RIP ENGINE & PREPARAÇÃO
          </span>
          <p class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs uppercase leading-relaxed opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100">
            Processamento de imagens rasterizadas com gerenciamento ICC de cor e imposição digital automática de rótulos.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 CMYK PRINTING -->
      <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-white/20 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 hover:bg-[#00aeef] hover:text-[#003e58] transition-all duration-300 group min-h-[180px] md:min-h-[260px] cursor-crosshair">
        <span class="font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-6xl font-black opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:text-[#003e58] transition-all">02</span>
        <div>
          <span class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs font-bold uppercase block mb-2 text-[#00aeef] group-hover:text-inherit">
            IMPRESSÃO DIGITAL CMYK
          </span>
          <p class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs uppercase leading-relaxed opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100">
            Microinjeção Memjet® DuraFlex a 1600x1600 dpi com gotas fixas de 1,2 picolitros em passagem única contínua.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 03 LAMINAÇÃO & ACABAMENTO -->
      <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-white/20 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 hover:bg-[#e11d48] hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 group min-h-[180px] md:min-h-[260px] cursor-crosshair">
        <span class="font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-6xl font-black opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:text-white transition-all">03</span>
        <div>
          <span class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs font-bold uppercase block mb-2 text-[#e11d48] group-hover:text-inherit">
            LAMINAÇÃO & PROTEÇÃO
          </span>
          <p class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs uppercase leading-relaxed opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100">
            Laminação a frio em linha e secagem NIR/UV para proteção contra solventes, água, umidade e abrasão física.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 04 FINAL CUT -->
      <div class="p-8 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 hover:bg-[#f59e0b] hover:text-black transition-all duration-300 group min-h-[180px] md:min-h-[260px] cursor-crosshair">
        <span class="font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-6xl font-black opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:text-black transition-all">04</span>
        <div>
          <span class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs font-bold uppercase block mb-2 text-[#f59e0b] group-hover:text-black">
            CORTE DIGITAL & LASER
          </span>
          <p class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs uppercase leading-relaxed opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100">
            Troquelagem óptica a laser CO2 ou lâmina tangencial de alta velocidade sem matriz mecânica, pronto para aplicação.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
